flowchart TB
 CLI[Bootstrap and CLI] --> Runtime[Application runtime]
 Runtime --> Router[HTTP/API router]
 Runtime --> Loader[Module/dependency loader]
 Router --> Auth[Authentication and authorization]
 Router --> Services[Application/domain services]
 Loader --> Modules[Addon/domain modules]
 Services --> Persistence[ORM/persistence abstraction]
 Persistence --> DB[(PostgreSQL or clone relational store)]
 Services --> Jobs[Jobs/events]
 Services --> Integrations[Integration adapters]
 Router --> Frontend[Frontend/client]
